<title>UK: P&amp;O welcomes EU clearance for Nedlloyd JV.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O welcomes EU clearance for Nedlloyd JV.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peninsular &amp; Oriental Steam Navigation Company (P&amp;O) said on Friday it welcomed the European Commission's approval for P&amp;O's container shipping merger with Royal Nedlloyd NV to go ahead without conditions.</p>
<p>&quot;This is very good news. It will enable the company to maintain the momentum built up over the last few weeks so that it will be fully operational at the start of 1997,&quot; P&amp;O said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the joint venture, P&amp;O Nedlloyd, would proceed as planned from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>P&amp;O and Nedlloyd announced the joint venture in September, creating one of the world's largest container shipping operators with annual turnover of nearly $4.0 billion.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
